Subject: [PATCH 418/488] [DS4.1] Padding rows in one TileLang launch

The routers' padding rows were two fills for the target and a
comparison plus a copy for the drafter. One TileLang launch writes
is_padding[i] = i >= live for both; the drafter's row index buffer goes.
---
